%% Title: MediSearch Analytics Dashboard Data Flow
flowchart LR
  OLTP[(Main Operational Database)] --> Extract[Extract Search, Inventory, Orders, Users]
  Raw[(Raw Storage)] --> Clean[Cleaning and Validation]
  Extract --> Transform[Transform and Aggregate]
  Clean --> Transform
  Transform --> Warehouse[(OLAP Warehouse)]
  Warehouse --> Metrics[Metric Layer]
  Metrics --> KPI[KPI Tables]
  KPI --> Dashboards[Admin and Pharmacy Dashboards]
  KPI --> Reports[Aggregated Reports]

  subgraph KPIs[Tracked KPIs]
    SearchDemand[Top Searched Drugs]
    PriceTrends[Price Trends]
    Availability[Availability and Stock Health]
    PharmacyPerf[Pharmacy Performance]
    Engagement[User Engagement]
  end

  Metrics --> SearchDemand & PriceTrends & Availability & PharmacyPerf & Engagement
  SearchDemand & PriceTrends & Availability & PharmacyPerf & Engagement --> Dashboards
